rule c1xx: the sy order of a block's locals is C1XX's scope hash table: 16 buckets of the name's 16-bit hash (c1xx!0x1040682d: h = c + (h >> 4) + 4h over the bytes, hash16 = (h >> 16) ^ (h & 0xffff), bucket = hash16 % 16), buckets upwards, each bucket newest declaration first; 32 names (more than 16: the table does not grow).
cl
il
  *"white" level 2 bucket 0*
  *"chi" level 2 bucket 0*
